		Heading 1:
			Text: Ligatures
		Paragraph: Some fonts have one glyph for a pair of letters such as fi or fl. By default each letter is its own glyph. With `Ligatures: true`, those of the font are used. They do not change what is read or copied, and a `Letter spacing` other than 0 turns them off.
